ent-ST14WeaponRifleMoritaCarbine = Morita carbine
    .desc = The standard-issue Federation carbine. Lighter and handier than the full rifle, it trades reach for a faster swing in close quarters.

ent-ST14WeaponRifleMoritaMarksman = Morita marksman
    .desc = A scoped Morita built for picking Arachnids off at range. Slower to shoulder, but it hits where you point it.

ent-ST14WeaponRifleMoritaRifle = Morita rifle
    .desc = The workhorse rifle of the Mobile Infantry. Reliable, serviceable, and chambered for the ammunition every trooper carries.

ent-ST14WeaponEngineerPistol = Engineer pistol
    .desc = A compact sidearm issued to engineering troops. Not much stopping power, but it is always within reach.
